Poulose et al. (2017) showed that diets supplemented with anthocyanin-rich blueberry were effective in suppressing deficits in rats’ cognitive function after acute doses of 56Fe particles.

Enhancing H2O2 detoxification capacity using a catalase-overexpressing transgenic mouse (MCATtg) suppresses 1H-induced impairment of neurogenesis (Liao et al., 2013) and cognition (Olsen et al., 2013;

